            <div class="about-card aftercare-card">
                <h2>Aftercare: How to Use Fougera Ointment Cream</h2>

                <p>
                    Use the ointment every day. The healing process
                    usually takes <strong>3 to 4 days</strong>.
                </p>

                <ol>
                    <li>Wash your hands with soap and water before touching your tattoo.</li>
                    <li>Gently wash the tattoo with lukewarm water and mild, unscented soap.</li>
                    <li>Pat dry with a clean paper towel. Do not rub.</li>
                    <li>Apply a thin layer of Fougera ointment cream. Do not put too much.</li>
                    <li>Repeat 2 to 3 times a day (morning, afternoon, and night) until healed.</li>
                </ol>

                <h3>Reminders</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Do not scratch or peel the tattoo, even if it itches.</li>
                    <li>Avoid direct sunlight, swimming, and soaking while healing.</li>
                    <li>Wear clean, loose clothing over the tattoo.</li>
                    <li>do not eat Fishy Foods </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

